    "title": "Live Launcher",
    "description": "Live Launcher is a customizable replacement for your home screen,that provides a focused, clean and unobtrusive user interface.\r\nLive Launcher improves and extends the features of your Android devices giving them a new home screen designed to be easier and faster to use,with themes and wallpapers as core functions.\r\nWhether you want to completely overhaul your home screens or are looking for a cleaner, faster home launcher,this is the answer.\r\n\r\n3D Animation\r\nStunning screen transition effects\r\nPowered by the most advanced 3D animation engine. Its various graphic effects will subvert the traditional plat interface, and make your operation more interesting, smooth and cool.\r\n\r\nPersonalize your home screen \r\nImpress your friends with Live Launcher's clean look and customize it to your needs. Personalize it with our integrated icon pack fonts, and wallpapers, or use your own.\r\n\r\nDecorate your phone with diverse themes\r\nFree themes: various categories. You can always find the one you like in this world biggest theme store!\r\n\r\nKeep your screen well-organized\r\nAutomatically sort your Apps into folders and keep your desktop tidy.\r\n\r\nCommonly used features in the launcher\r\nWe have integrated a variety of common tools such as weather, notification bar cleaning, news, themes, wallpapers, etc. to make it convenient for users to use.\r\n\r\nTHANK YOU SO MUCH FOR YOUR USING MY APPLICATION!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Live Launcher is a customizable replacement for your home screen,that provides a focused, clean and unobtrusive user interface.<br>Live Launcher improves and extends the features of your Android devices giving them a new home screen designed to be easier and faster to use,with themes and wallpapers as core functions.<br>Whether you want to completely overhaul your home screens or are looking for a cleaner, faster home launcher,this is the answer.<br><br>3D Animation<br>Stunning screen transition effects<br>Powered by the most advanced 3D animation engine. Its various graphic effects will subvert the traditional plat interface, and make your operation more interesting, smooth and cool.<br><br>Personalize your home screen <br>Impress your friends with Live Launcher&#39;s clean look and customize it to your needs. Personalize it with our integrated icon pack fonts, and wallpapers, or use your own.<br><br>Decorate your phone with diverse themes<br>Free themes: various categories. You can always find the one you like in this world biggest theme store!<br><br>Keep your screen well-organized<br>Automatically sort your Apps into folders and keep your desktop tidy.<br><br>Commonly used features in the launcher<br>We have integrated a variety of common tools such as weather, notification bar cleaning, news, themes, wallpapers, etc. to make it convenient for users to use.<br><br>THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR YOUR USING MY APPLICATION!",
